        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CDG35, Door Security Chain With Doorbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Door Security Chain With Doorbolt security door guard features 2 types of protection: a sliding doorbolt style security door guard and a secondary chain protection. The sliding doorbolt locks the door to the frame. You can release the doorbolt and crack the door open, while leaving the security chain attached. Packaged with matching finish screws and available in 8 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CDG35.gif?v=1704354761\" width=\"600\" height=\"302\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Security Chain With Doorbolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOther Security Door Guards we carry:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-security-door-guard-deltana-dg425\"><b>4 Inch Door Guard</b></a> -  \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-5-inch-security-door-guard-deltana-dg525\"><b>5 Inch Door Guard</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/contemporary-security-door-guard-with-ball-tension-action-deltana-dgsb675\"><b>Contemporary Door Guard</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specification</b> for the Deltana CDG35 Door Security Chain With Doorbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Security Chain Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting screws</b>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CDG35.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CDG35 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
